# Ignore everything by default, then whitelist seed asset folders.
# Needs both levels: "!folder/" (so git descends into it) and
# "!folder/**" (so its files are re-included).
# User-uploaded runtime data (users/, sertifikat/) stays ignored so
# every account uploads its own files.
*
!.gitignore
!logos/
!logos/**
!landing-sliders/
!landing-sliders/**
!news/
!news/**
!alumni/
!alumni/**
!mitra/
!mitra/**
!galeri/
!galeri/**
!sliders/
!sliders/**
!struktur-organisasi/
!struktur-organisasi/**
!prestasi/
!prestasi/**
!documents/
!documents/**
!berita/
!berita/**
!fasilitas/
!fasilitas/**
